  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1819.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1819.01 Purpose.\n\n(a) The purpose of this part is to establish the scope of training required to obtain and renew a certification pursuant to Env-A 1818.\n\n(b) The training described in this part is intended to supplement, and not to replace or wholly satisfy, federal training requirements for working with asbestos, including, as applicable:\n\n(1) 29 CFR 1926.1101;\n\n(2) 29 CFR 1910.120; and\n\n(3) 40 CFR 763.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
